  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Reform for the Knowledge Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will support the Government&apos;s program to improve equitable access for male and female students for a higher education system that is financially and institutionally sustainable, with incentives to improve system quality and relevance.  The project will support policy reforms that will: (i) improve the Government&apos;s capacity to diversify and improve financing mechanisms; (ii) modernize the governance and management efficacy of the sector; and (iii) strengthen quality assurance and accreditation mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
